  "referenceNumber": "RUS1982",
  "remarks": "\nPaloma Precious DMCC is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 on the following ground: Paloma Precious DMCC is involved in destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine as it makes available funds to a person that makes available economic resources that could contribute to destabilising Ukraine or undermining or threatening the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine. \n",
